Ayo. Dorong, Bu, dorong!

46
00:07:14,302 --> 00:07:15,569
Begitu, begitu.

47
00:07:15,603 --> 00:07:17,939
Ayo, ayo. Dorong!

48
00:07:35,455 --> 00:07:36,590
Katakan padaku.

49
00:07:36,624 --> 00:07:38,159
Itu...

50
00:07:38,960 --> 00:07:40,294
Itu anak laki-laki.

51
00:07:40,361 --> 00:07:43,130
Tidak, tidak!

52
00:07:43,631 --> 00:07:46,499
Itu tidak mungkin benar. Tidak, tolong!

53
00:07:47,935 --> 00:07:50,470
Maafkan aku, nak.

54
00:07:51,038 --> 00:07:52,606
Maaf.

55
00:07:52,640 --> 00:07:55,042
Maaf.

56
00:08:03,818 --> 00:08:05,953
Begini, Bu.

57
00:08:06,020 --> 00:08:08,289
Bukan aku yang membuat aturan ini.

58
00:08:08,322 --> 00:08:09,957
Begitulah cara kami.

59
00:08:09,991 --> 00:08:13,327
Kamu dan anak laki-laki itu harus menebus dosa suamimu.

60
00:08:13,427 --> 00:08:15,196
Ini tidak adil!

61
00:08:15,296 --> 00:08:18,532
Hidup memang jarang adil.

62
