141
00:14:20,562 --> 00:14:22,630
Sialan!

142
00:14:22,664 --> 00:14:24,632
Dia bukan anak laki-laki.

143
00:14:24,666 --> 00:14:25,966
Dia iblis.

144
00:14:25,999 --> 00:14:29,236
Musuh bagi segala sesuatu yang suci.

145
00:14:29,838 --> 00:14:30,772
